# Joraga Invocation: only the creatures Bot1 controls as it resolves get +3/+3 (CR 611.2c), but "must be blocked this turn if able" is a rule
# of the game that reaches a creature that arrives later in the turn (CR 509.1c, 611.2c). Raging Goblin (1/1, haste) is cast after Joraga
# resolves and stays 1/1, and Savannah Lions is 5/4. Both attack; Bot2's two creatures must block one each, so declaring no blocks or two
# blockers on the Lions is refused. The Goblin and Elite Vanguard (2/1) kill each other.

